WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,900 --> 00:00:03,800
Teacher Jiang

2
00:00:04,300 --> 00:00:13,410
What kind of wind brought you here today? Try some acting

3
00:00:13,850 --> 00:00:17,390
Much better than the last batch

4
00:00:17,710 --> 00:00:20,630
This is your craftsmanship. This craftsmanship is pretty good.

5
00:00:22,190 --> 00:00:23,190
Let's talk business

6
00:00:23,900 --> 00:00:26,700
In this batch, use half a can of oil for two smoked fishes

7
00:00:28,400 --> 00:00:31,080
From now on, I will pay for all the salt you need to marinate your meat when you travel far away.

8
00:00:31,640 --> 00:00:34,860
How did you know I was going on a long trip? You asked me twice

9
00:00:34,860 --> 00:00:35,900
Research how much meat to marinate

10
00:00:36,420 --> 00:00:37,340
Carry everything on your back

11
00:00:37,460 --> 00:00:38,420
I dare not take the long way

12
00:00:39,180 --> 00:00:41,300
Teacher Jiang is famous for his good drills

13
00:00:41,930 --> 00:00:46,100
But in the future, we will have to discuss the show again. How do you want to discuss it?

14
00:00:47,060 --> 00:00:49,900
The meat on this island is in your hands, and the salt is in my hands.

15
00:00:50,420 --> 00:00:51,540
The whole island lives a good life

16
00:00:51,700 --> 00:00:52,780
They all have to pass through us

17
00:00:53,420 --> 00:00:59,460
Let's decide which day it will be

18
00:00:59,860 --> 00:01:03,750
I won’t buy salt from you anymore. You cook your meat and I’ll boil mine.

19
00:01:04,350 --> 00:01:12,220
Whoever lifts the frame and suppresses the frame breaks the rules. I have accounts here. No one can come and lose them. I will be your salt in the future.

20
00:01:12,420 --> 00:01:22,050
Send me here first and then leave to deal with Xia Shining

21
00:01:23,850 --> 00:01:26,990
If you want to change your employer someday, tell me.

22
00:01:27,390 --> 00:01:28,510
It's good to be at Teacher Jiang's place

23
00:01:29,240 --> 00:01:30,400
You dare to poach people in front of me

24
00:01:30,720 --> 00:01:35,320
Don’t be afraid that I’ll wash it for you in the future. It’s just a joke. I’ve gained some meat and carried a lot of it.

25
00:01:35,720 --> 00:01:36,800
Find time to take a trip somewhere

26
00:01:37,120 --> 00:01:38,160
Look how big this island is
